Error [E0127]: Rounded unit conversion needs nonnegative digits
  --> tests/ui/quantity_rounded_negative_digits.jet:7:58
    |
  7 |     Meter.from_half_rounded(1half, .NearestEven, digits: -1) ?? panic("invalid digits")
    |                                                          ^^
 Why: Digits counts destination decimal places
 Fix: Write `digits: 0` or another nonnegative Int
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0127
